Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.30,0:02:13.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星际迷航：无限太空》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.00,0:04:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tactical…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,视像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visual…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,作战，准备发炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tactical, stand by on torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.87,0:05:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evasive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,E9通讯站叫哥伦比亚号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is comm station Epsilon IX, calling USS Columbia…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥伦比亚号，请通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in, Columbia. Respond, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.99,0:06:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是E9，正在增强输出功率\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Epsilon IX. Am boosting output…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.39,0:06:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接收到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How read you this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,侦察机哥伦比亚号，会合神圣号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scout Columbia NCC-621 to rendezvous with Scout Revere NCC-595…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.80,0:06:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际日期7411.4\N{\fnArial\fs30}On stardate 7411.4…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.91,0:06:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,进一步指令将在这个时间转发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Further orders to be relayed at that time…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队普博指挥官示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signed, Commodore Probert, Starfleet…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,传讯完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}End of transmission…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法辨识入侵者 发光云雾应该是强大力场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lntruder unidentified.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,包围着异星太空船，无法扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe luminescent cloudto be enormous power fieldsurrounding alien vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.28,0:07:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林岗皇家巡洋舰 阿玛号继续攻击…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our sensor scans unable to penetrate. lmperial Klingon Cruiser Amar, continuing to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我方侦察机在L14区截听到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our sensor drone is intercepting this on Quad I-1 4…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,克林冈境内，他们在对抗什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's within Klingon boundaries. Who are they fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unknown, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一个外界视像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an exterior visual…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经标出那股星际云的航向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've plotted a course on that cloud, Commander…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.25,0:08:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会进入颇接近我们的联盟太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will pass into Federation space fairly close to us…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝向哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，它正朝着地球前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sir, it's on a precise heading for Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的祖先在此摒弃他们的兽欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our ancestors cast out their animal passions here on these sands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,藉着高灵亚拯救我们的族人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our race was saved by the attainment of Kolinahr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.29,0:09:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,透过高灵亚，一切情感都被抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kolinahr: through which all emotion is finally shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴，你辛劳了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have laboured long, Spock…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也证明了自己有资格…接受我们这个纯逻辑的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now receive from us this symbol of total logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.89,0:10:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的思想交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your thoughts… give them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.57,0:10:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的思想结合了，冼朴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our minds, Spock…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,合而为一\N{\fnArial\fs30}one and together…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:11:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到意识从太空召唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This consciousness calling to you from space…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.66,0:11:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人类血液被它触及了，冼朴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lt touches your human blood, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.97,0:11:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没有达到高灵亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have not achieved Kolinahr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.81,0:11:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要到别处寻找他的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}His answer lies elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.45,0:11:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会在这里找到它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will not achieve his goal with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.35,0:11:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你长寿昌盛，冼朴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live long and prosper, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:57.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（星舰总部 星际日期7410.2）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.57,0:12:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被委任为企业号的科学员了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cmdr Sonak, you were appointed as Enterprise Science Officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 根据你的推荐 - 你何不上船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Based on your recommendation. - Why aren't you aboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克队长叫我出发前做最后简报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capt Decker requested I complete final briefing here before we leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在星际舰队？\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Starfleet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.43,0:12:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号正在做出发前最后准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enterprise is in final preparation to leave dock…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那需要二十小时 - 十二小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which requires 20 hours. - 12…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去见诺古拉司令，不会很久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm meeting Admiral Nogura. I won't be more than three minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后在企业号上向我报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to me on the Enterprise in one hour…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你报到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,会议后我打算登上那艘太空船\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my intention to be on that ship following that meeting…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.12,0:12:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后向我报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to me in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.70,0:13:54.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（办公室楼层）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 司令 - 史葛先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Admiral. - Mr Scott…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.49,0:14:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二小时后出发，不是认真的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those departure orders, 12 hours. Starfleet cannot be serious…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.83,0:14:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何那些输送器仍未操作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't the transporters operating?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.26,0:14:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小问题，暂时性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wee problem. Temporary…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.53,0:14:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚完成18个月的企业号改装\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have just finished 18 months' redesigning the Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.60,0:14:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎能12小时后出发 - 送我去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How can she be ready in 12 hours? - Take me over, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.88,0:14:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要试航\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs more work, a shakedown…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个杀伤力惊人的外来物体…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Scott, an alien object of unbelievable destructive power…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不足三天就会来到地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is less than three days away from Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.85,0:14:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拦截范围内的飞船只有企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only starship in interception range is the Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.79,0:14:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何，她要在12小时后发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready or not, she launches in 12 hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,船员没有足够时间熟习新仪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crew haven't had near enough time with all the new equipment…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且引擎也未测试翘曲动力飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the engines are not even tested at warp power…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.29,0:15:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个不熟练的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And an untried captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当了星际舰队行动总管两年半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two and a half years as Chief of Starfleet Operations…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.46,0:15:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能状态不佳，但并非不熟练\N{\fnArial\fs30}May have made me stale, but I wouldn't consider myself untried…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.64,0:15:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们把她还给我 - 把她交还？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They gave her back to me, Scotty. - Gave her back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑诺古拉可会那么易商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt it was that easy with Nogura…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何有这个能耐的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, any man who could manage such a feat…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.82,0:15:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不敢怠慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not dare to disappoint…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，她会作好准备，依时出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll launch on time, sir, and she'll be ready…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.45,0:20:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Mr Scott. - Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.79,0:20:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,货物站叫发射人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cargo bay to launch crew…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,输送囊在六号船坞候命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travel pod is now available at dock six…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.03,0:21:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请批准登船 - 批准，欢迎司令\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Permission to come aboard. - Granted. Welcome aboard, Admiral…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.83,0:21:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,史葛指挥官，工程组找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cmdr Scott, you're needed in Engineering…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you'll excuse me…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行甲板，准备穿梭机进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flight deck, prepare for incoming shuttlecraft…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.24,0:21:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请跟我来… - 我识路的，安山\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you'll follow me…- I think I can find my way, Ensign…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.98,0:21:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.93,0:21:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你一小时前接驳了线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you had that circuit patched in an hour ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.53,0:21:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，但我们要把它切断\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did. We had to disconnect it…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.51,0:21:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽快找人去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get somebody there as soon as I can…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.35,0:22:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，星际舰队传来了指挥调动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain! Starfleet just signalled your transfer-of-command orders…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 队长 - 谢谢大家欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Captain. - I appreciate the welcome…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿情况没有这么严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish circumstances were less critical…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.00,0:22:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,E9正监察入侵者，开启一条频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Epsilon IX is monitoring the intruder. Keep a channel open…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.67,0:22:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克队长在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Capt Decker?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.21,0:22:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在工程部，他…不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in Engineering, sir. He…doesn't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.58,0:22:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柴可夫先生 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Chekov. - Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.48,0:22:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫船员0400小时在休憩甲板集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assemble the crew on the recreation deck at 0400 hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给他们展示我们要面对什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to show them what we're facing…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.65,0:22:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇里接受六号检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check Cleary on number six…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.24,0:22:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮机室通告全舰 三分钟内测试辅助动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engine room informs the whole ship to test auxiliary power within 3 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.77,0:23:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，输送机感应器失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. The transporter sensor was not activated…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.91,0:23:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不完善的船舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faulty modules…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.25,0:23:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇里，安装新的后备感应器进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cleary, put a new backup sensor into the unit…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.09,0:23:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛克司令，我们有要员送别呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral Kirk. We're getting a top-brass sendoff…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.29,0:23:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们即使要用手拖也要依时出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll launch on schedule if we have to tow her with our hands. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, that we will, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们谈一下 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's talk. - Sure…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.37,0:23:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告后备组件何时准备好 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tell me when the backup's ready. - Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.94,0:23:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，我希望这不是打气的说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I hope this isn't some kind of pep talk…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.27,0:23:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很忙的 - 韦，我会接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm too busy. - I'm taking over, Will…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.98,0:23:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.21,0:23:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会代替你做企业号的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm replacing you as Captain of the Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.92,0:23:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会继续留任做执行员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll stay on as Executive Officer…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.12,0:24:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时降职至指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temporary grade reduction to Commander…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.16,0:24:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你亲自执行指挥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You personally are assuming command?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.46,0:24:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.03,0:24:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可否问原因？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经在太空对付不名物体五年\N{\fnArial\fs30}My experience. Five years out there dealing with unknowns like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.77,0:24:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我熟识企业号和它的船员\N{\fnArial\fs30}My familiarity with the Enterprise, its crew…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.84,0:24:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令，这艘几乎全新的企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Admiral, this is an almost totally new Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.41,0:24:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我更熟识它 - 所以你留在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know her like I do. - That's why you're staying aboard…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.29,0:24:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，韦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Will…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.32,0:24:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,司令，我认为你完全没有歉意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Admiral, I don't think you're sorry, not one damn bit…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.46,0:24:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你推荐我作指挥时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when you recommended me for command…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.83,0:24:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说多希望找到办法再指挥飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said how much you hoped you'd find a way to get a starship again…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.87,0:24:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，看来你找到办法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sir, it looks like you found a way…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.71,0:25:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官，马上到驾驶室报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report to the bridge, Commander, immediately…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.73,0:25:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,输送室，请通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transporter room. Come in…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.70,0:25:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,输送器上出现了红线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red line on the transporter…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.67,0:25:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别接合 - 太迟了，它们在发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Transporter, do not engage. - It's too late. They're beaming…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.91,0:25:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到吗？撤销我们，把他们拉回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me, Starfleet? Override us. PulI them back…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.01,0:25:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能撤回他们了，企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unable to retrieve their pattern, Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.86,0:25:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.76,0:25:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队，增强物体接收讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet, boost your matter gain. We need more signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.74,0:25:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要多一点讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}More signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.14,0:26:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们失去形状 - 他们在形成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're losing their pattern. - No, they're forming…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.60,0:26:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队，接收到他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet, do you have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.87,0:26:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号，我们接收到的东西死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise, what we got back didn't live long, fortunately…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.41,0:26:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队，是葛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet, Kirk…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.02,0:26:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,请代我向他们的家人致哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please express my condolences to their families…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.59,0:26:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以透过火神星大使馆接触桑尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cmdr Sonak's can be reached through the Vulcan Embassy…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.00,0:27:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰，你没什么可以做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was nothing you could have done, Rand…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.93,0:27:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.16,0:27:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 涡轮发动机八号？- 在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeoman, turboshaft eight? - Back that way, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.90,0:27:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找个火神星人接替桑尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must replace Cmdr Sonak. I'd still like a Vulcan if possible…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.91,0:27:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人对这设计是完全熟识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None available, Captain. No one's fully rated on this design…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.82,0:27:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你熟识，你要兼当科学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are, Mr Decker. You'll have to double as Science Officer…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.09,0:28:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所知的只有这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all we know about it…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.89,0:28:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了它现在距离地球53.4小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}except that it is now 53.4 hours away from Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号是唯一在它途中的飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise is the only Federation starship that stands in its way…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.70,0:28:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务是要拦截、 调查…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our orders are to intercept, investigate…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.27,0:28:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,和采取有必要及可行的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take whatever action is necessary. And possible…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.37,0:29:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望那个物体上有生命，了解我们的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can only hope that there is a life form aboard that vessel…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.52,0:29:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶室叫队长，E9有紧急讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge to Captain. Priority signal from Epsilon IX…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.22,0:29:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 传上视像器 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put it on viewer. - On viewer…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.02,0:29:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号，那股星云是某种强力场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise, the cloud is definitely a power field of some kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.59,0:29:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,直径…我的天…有超过两埃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Measures…my God…over two AUs in diameter…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.86,0:29:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面一定有种神奇的东西产生它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be something incredible inside there generating it…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.17,0:29:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在各波段发放友好讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're transmitting friendship messages on all frequencies…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.24,0:29:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有回应 - 中心没有读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No response. - NulI reading at the centre…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.11,0:29:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面没有东西，但扫描全被射回\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something inside, but all scans are reflected back…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.81,0:29:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有动力上升 - 接收到个怪图像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A power surge. - Receiving an odd pattern…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.55,0:29:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能把我们的扫描视为敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could be viewing our scans as a hostile act…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.82,0:29:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们对扫描反应 - 导向器全速\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're reacting to our scans. - Deflectors, fulI!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.46,0:30:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们被袭击 - 外界情况视像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are under attack. - External view…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.12,0:31:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭视像器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viewer off…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.97,0:31:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射倒数在四十分钟后开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pre-launch countdown will commence in 40 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.99,0:31:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,输送器系统完全修复和运作正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transporter system fully repaired and functioning, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.69,0:31:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,接合讯号清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dock signals clear…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.23,0:31:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,回覆我们正等候最后船员更换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reply we are awaiting final crew replacements…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.13,0:31:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.03,0:31:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,输送员报告领航员是伊莉亚中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transporter personnel reports the navigator It Ilia…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.37,0:31:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她已经登船，正前来驾驶室\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's already aboard and en route to the bridge, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.27,0:32:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，她是德尔塔星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's Deltan, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.51,0:32:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官，伊莉亚中尉报到 - 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It Ilia reporting for duty, sir. - Welcome aboard, lieutenant…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.55,0:32:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好，伊莉亚 - 迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Ilia. - Decker…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.69,0:32:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几年前驻守在中尉的星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stationed on the lieutenant's home planet some years ago…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.19,0:32:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克指挥官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cmdr Decker?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.46,0:32:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的执行及科学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Exec and Science Officer…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.26,0:32:28.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛克队长对我有绝对信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capt Kirk has the utmost confidence in me…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.90,0:32:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你也是，中尉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in you too, lieutenant…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.00,0:32:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已发禁欲誓言，可工作了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My oath of celibacy is on record. May I assume my duties?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.14,0:32:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}By all means…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.11,0:32:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，最后六个船员准备输送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, our last six crew members are ready to beam up…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.32,0:32:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其中一个拒绝踏入输送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one of them is refusing to step into the transporter…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.35,0:32:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去确保他进行输送，输送室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see to it that he beams up. Transporter room…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.67,0:33:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发誓永不回星际舰队的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you swore never to return to Starfleet!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.64,0:33:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，等一等，我会解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a moment, Captain, sir. I'll explain what happened…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.48,0:33:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受敬重的诺古拉上将\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your revered Admiral Nogura…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.61,0:33:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,实施鲜为人知的征用后备军条例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invoked a little-known, seldom-used reserve activation clause…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.52,0:33:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单而言，他们征召我入伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}In simpler language, Captain, they drafted me…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.55,0:33:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.02,0:33:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的主意，是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your idea, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.46,0:33:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面有一样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a thing out there…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.03,0:33:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何我们不懂的物体都叫东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any object we don't understand is always a "thing"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.16,0:33:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝着这方向来的，我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Headed this way. I need you…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.27,0:33:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死，邦斯，我很需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, Bones, I need you. Badly…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.85,0:34:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请批准登船 - 批准，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Permission to come aboard? - Permission granted, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.86,0:34:22.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，听说卓普现在是医生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Jim, I hear Chapel's an MD now…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.24,0:34:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个高级护士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to need a top nurse…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.44,0:34:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是个跟我争辩每个诊断的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a doctor who'll argue every diagnosis with me…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.61,0:34:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能把整个医疗室也改装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They probably redesigned the whole sickbay, too…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.15,0:34:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程师们喜欢改动东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engineers love to change things…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.24,0:34:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,船坞控制室说准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dock control reports ready, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.17,0:35:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 舵轮准备好了 - 出发轨道标定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Helm ready, sir. - Orbital departure on plot, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.64,0:35:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,横杆指挥部示意妥当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yard Command signalling clear, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.55,0:35:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 控制推进器 - 控制推进器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manoeuvring thrusters, Mr Sulu. - Manoeuvring thrusters…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.88,0:35:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold station…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.35,0:35:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,推进器已经定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrusters at station-keeping, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.87,0:35:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏洛先生，推进器前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrusters ahead, Mr Sulu…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.18,0:35:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take us out…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.00,0:37:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定混合模式，你可用脉冲动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intermix set, bridge. Impulse power at your discretion…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.30,0:37:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,推进动力，苏洛先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impulse power, Mr Sulu…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.44,0:37:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进，翘曲度五级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahead, warp point five…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 显示起飞角度视像 - 起飞角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Departure angle on viewer. - Departure angle…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.70,0:37:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示前方视像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viewer ahead…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.89,0:38:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际日期7412.6发射后1.8小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's log, stardate 7412.6, 1.8 hours from launch…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.93,0:38:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了尽快拦截入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order to intercept the intruder at the earliest possible time…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.93,0:38:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在太阳系中冒险作翘曲飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must risk engaging warp drive while still within the solar system…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.10,0:38:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设我们完全有翘曲飞行性能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, assuming we have fulI warp capability…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.48,0:38:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在太阳系外加速至翘曲度第七级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accelerating to warp seven outside the solar system…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.38,0:38:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让我们在20.1小时拦截入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will bring us to IP with the intruder in 20.1 hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.68,0:38:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学员计算确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science officer's computation confirmed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.99,0:38:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦斯，你满意那些新设备吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bones, do the new facilities meet with your approval?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.26,0:38:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不满意，像在电脑中心工作似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not. It's like working in a computer centre…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.83,0:38:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 程式准备了 - 调校作翘曲飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Programming ready? - Set for warp entry…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.40,0:38:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我仍提议作进一步模拟研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I still recommend further simulation study…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.63,0:39:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那物体每过一分钟就更接近地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Decker, every minute brings that object closer to Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.17,0:39:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程人员，准备作翘曲推进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engineering, stand by for warp drive…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.28,0:39:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还要进一步模拟流动感应器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need further simulation on flow sensors…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.98,0:39:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程师，我们现在要翘曲速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engineer, we need warp speed now…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.05,0:39:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，你在咄咄逼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, you're pushing…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.85,0:39:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的下属明白他们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your people know their jobs…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.32,0:39:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就这样，我已尽了力 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it. I can't do any better. - Aye, lad…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.63,0:39:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,模拟器勉强可行，我不能保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's borderline on the simulator. I cannot guarantee she'll hold up…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.67,0:39:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲推进 翘曲度一级前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp drive, Mr Scott. Ahead, warp one, Mr Sulu…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.64,0:39:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速至翘曲度一级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accelerating to warp one, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.55,0:39:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲度七级…八级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp point seven…point eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.53,0:39:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲度一级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp one, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.66,0:40:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Decker…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠕虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wormhole…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.80,0:40:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速调回用脉冲动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us back on impulse power. FulI reverse…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.09,0:40:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵轮控制失效，调回用脉冲动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative helm control. Going reverse on impulse power…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.16,0:40:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,子空间频率被干扰，蠕虫洞效应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subspace frequencies jammed, sir. Wormhole effect…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.07,0:40:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制失效会持续22.5秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative control will continue 22.5 seconds…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.31,0:40:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后会减至负光速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before velocity slows to sublight speed…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.58,0:40:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面的蠕虫洞里有不明小型物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unidentified small object is in the wormhole with us, directly ahead…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.31,0:40:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开障碍力场，视像器显示物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force fields up fulI. Put object on viewer…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.29,0:41:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,人手操控舵轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manual override on helm…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.16,0:41:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有反应 - 准备导航器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No manual response. - Navigational deflectors coming up…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.96,0:41:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,畸变令动力系统负荷过量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Distortion has overloaded power systems…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.67,0:41:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,导航器失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navigational deflectors inoperative…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.07,0:41:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,方向控制仪也失灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Directional control also inoperative…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.98,0:41:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 撞击时间？- 二十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to impact? - 20 seconds…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.18,0:41:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,柴可夫先生，准备突变仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Chekov, stand by on phasers…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.19,0:41:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.53,0:41:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,延迟那个突变仪的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belay that phaser order…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.94,0:41:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备光子炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arm photon torpedoes…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.62,0:42:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,光子炮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Photon torpedoes…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.22,0:42:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…armed…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.07,0:42:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标是个小行星，质量读数七级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Object is an asteroid. Reading mass point seven…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.84,0:42:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准小行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targeting asteroid…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.71,0:42:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒内撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impact in ten seconds…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.52,0:42:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,八秒内撞击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impact in eight seconds…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.56,0:42:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire torpedoes…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.56,0:42:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 六秒 - 已经发炮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Six. - Torpedoes away…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.60,0:42:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,四秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.66,0:43:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵轮控制恢复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helm control restored, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.63,0:43:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 报告位置 - 计算新的交叉航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Position report, Navigator. - Computing new intersection course…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.67,0:43:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通讯正常 - 无损毁报告，队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Communications normal. - Negative damage reported, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.51,0:43:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生，无受伤报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}No casualties reported, Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,错，有受伤，是我的神智\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong, Mr Chekov. There are casualties. My wits…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.35,0:43:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如「受惊吓」，队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in "frightened out of", Captain, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.85,0:43:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在翘曲度八级，报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at warp point eight. Engineer, report your status there…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.89,0:43:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等，我们正在了解情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a second. We're picking up the pieces down here…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.73,0:44:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,史葛先生，我们要翘曲推进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Scott, we need warp drive…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.66,0:44:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个引擎失调造成那个蠕虫洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}An engine imbalance created the wormhole in the first place…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.40,0:44:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要矫正它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must correct it…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.40,0:44:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那物体离地球不足两天，要拦截\N{\fnArial\fs30}That object is less than two days from Earth. We must intercept it…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.38,0:44:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,领航员，设定新航导配合拦截点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navigator, lay in a new heading to conform with our initial IP…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.48,0:44:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏洛先生，你暂代指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Sulu, you have the conn…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.25,0:44:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克先生，到我的舱房见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Decker, I'd like to see you in my quarters…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.72,0:44:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我跟着来吗，队长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I tag along, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.69,0:44:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,五楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Level five.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.34,0:44:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释为何要收回我的突变仪命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explanation. Why was my phaser order countermanded?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.41,0:44:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,改装了的企业号透过它的主引擎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Enterprise redesign increases phaser power…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.24,0:44:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以增强突变动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}By channelling it through the main engines…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.91,0:44:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它们出现反物质不平衡时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they went into antimatter imbalance…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.48,0:44:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些突变仪就自动切断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The phasers were automatically cut off…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.32,0:45:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然你做得很对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You acted properly, of course…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.46,0:45:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过奖，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.83,0:45:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉若果我令你尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry if I embarrassed you…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.73,0:45:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拯救了飞船 - 我明白，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You saved the ship. - I'm aware of that, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.74,0:45:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再和我竞争，迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop competing with me, Decker…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.11,0:45:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请求批准直言 - 批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Permission to speak freely? - Granted…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.88,0:45:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你两年半来没有作过星际飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't logged a single star hour in two and a half years…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.48,0:45:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上你不熟识这艘飞船的新设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, plus your unfamiliarity with the ship's redesign…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.58,0:45:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为会严重危害这次任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my opinion, seriously jeopardises this mission…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.89,0:45:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你会协助我解决这些困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you will… nursemaid me through these difficulties, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.57,0:45:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官，我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, I'll do that…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.93,0:45:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我不阻延你执行任务了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I won't keep you from your duties any longer…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.14,0:45:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是，医生？- 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, Doctor? - Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.98,0:45:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，他可能是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may be right, Jim…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.92,0:46:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难应付？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it difficult?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.59,0:46:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早料到，像重遇你般难应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more than I expected. About as difficult as seeing you again…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.73,0:46:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 因你离开德尔塔四号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - That you left Delta IV?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.54,0:46:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你不辞而别？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or that you didn't even say goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.21,0:46:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,若果当时我再遇上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had seen you again…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.58,0:46:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得出再见吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}.. would you have been able to say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.02,0:46:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.40,0:46:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说吧，医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make your point, Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.47,0:46:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你在跟自己竞争\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is it is you who's competing…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.64,0:46:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你强行向星际舰队得到这次指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rammed getting this command down Starfleet's throat…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.47,0:46:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用这次紧急事件得回企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've used this emergency to get the Enterprise back…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.64,0:47:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我打算保留她，是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I intend to keep her, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.81,0:47:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.85,0:47:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种迷恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an obsession…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.02,0:47:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以蒙蔽你处理更紧急的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}An obsession that can blind you to more critical responsibilities…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.19,0:47:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对迪克的反应就是个例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your reaction to Decker is an example, Jim…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.43,0:47:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶室叫队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge to Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.70,0:47:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开启视像器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viewer on…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.86,0:47:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘联盟登记的远程穿梭机发讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal from a Federation-registered long-range shuttle…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.37,0:47:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望飞到我们旁边和锁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wishes to come alongside and lock on…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.64,0:47:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.04,0:47:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安扫描显示它有一级特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security scan shows it has a grade-one priority, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.78,0:47:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认属非交战身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non-belligerency confirmed…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.95,0:47:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑它是某种信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect it is a courier of some kind…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.11,0:47:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，柴可夫先生，去看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, Mr Chekov. See to it…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.32,0:47:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉视像器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viewer off…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.35,0:47:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意见听过了，还有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your opinion has been noted. Anything further?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.49,0:47:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要视乎你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That depends on you…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.40,0:49:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有登船者，非活跃星际舰队人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security scan. One boarder. Identity, Starfleet inactive…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.71,0:49:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，要求批准登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Permission to come aboard, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.91,0:49:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,批准，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granted, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.26,0:49:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么…是… - 冼朴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why… it's Mr… - Spock!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.01,0:49:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官，我可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander, if I may?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.11,0:49:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.46,0:50:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我监察过你跟星际舰队的通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I monitored your communications with Starfleet, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.83,0:50:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们的引擎设计有困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm aware of your engine-design difficulties…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.47,0:50:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意当科学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer my services as Science Officer…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.10,0:50:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我冒犯，指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Commander…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.51,0:50:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的执行员不反对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Exec has no objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.18,0:50:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不反对，我知道冼朴先生的资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I know Mr Spock's qualifications…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.98,0:50:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,柴可夫先生，重编冼朴先生入队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Chekov, log Mr Spock's Starfleet commission reactivated…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.65,0:50:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,编他做科学员\N{\fnArial\fs30}List him as Science Officer…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.89,0:50:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个…立刻生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both…effective immediately…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.59,0:50:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Spock!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.92,0:50:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来帮我吧，我很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so help me, I'm actually pleased to see you…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.17,0:50:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们都是 - 队长你容许的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's how we all feel. - Captain, with your permission…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.88,0:51:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去跟工程师讨论燃料方程式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will discuss fuel equations with the Engineer…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.32,0:51:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Spock…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.69,0:51:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome aboard…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.08,0:51:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长日志，星际日期7413.4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's log, stardate 7413.4…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.22,0:51:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸得冼朴先生及时到来相助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to Mr Spock's timely arrival and assistance…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.22,0:51:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们使引擎恢复至翘曲全功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the engines rebalanced into fulI warp capacity…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.89,0:51:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,修理时间不足三小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repair time less than three hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.33,0:51:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们距离地球一天多…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will be able to intercept intruder…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.86,0:51:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍可以拦截到入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}While still more than a day from Earth…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.57,0:51:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲度八级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp, point eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.64,0:52:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,九级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point nine…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.98,0:52:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,二级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp two…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.29,0:52:14.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,三级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp three…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.49,0:52:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,四级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp four…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.03,0:52:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,五级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp five…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.03,0:52:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,六级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp six…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.61,0:52:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,七级，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp seven, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.66,0:52:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学员应召报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science Officer Spock reporting as ordered…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.26,0:52:57.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sit down…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.37,0:53:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点也没有改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't changed a bit…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.47,0:53:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟从前一样友善合群\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just as warm and sociable as ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.57,0:53:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没有改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor have you…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.51,0:53:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偏爱离题万丈的言词\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your predilection for irrelevancy demonstrates…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.08,0:53:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.98,0:53:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后报告说你留在火神星的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last report, you were on Vulcan. Apparently to stay…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.05,0:53:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对，你要接受高灵亚的训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you were undergoing the Kolineer discipline…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.52,0:53:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.86,0:53:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你指的是高灵亚，你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are referring to the Kolinahr, Doctor, you are correct…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.70,0:53:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫什么也好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, however it's pronounced, Mr Spock…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.73,0:53:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是驱走所有情感的火神星仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Vulcan ritual supposed to purge all remaining emotions…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.67,0:53:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你违抗了高灵亚的纪律来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Kolinahr is also a discipline you broke…to join us…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.18,0:53:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐下来好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you, please… sit down?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.46,0:54:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在火神星感到一股强大意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Vulcan, I began sensing a consciousness…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.36,0:54:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我从来没感觉过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}More powerful than I have ever encountered…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.60,0:54:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是绝对完好的思想模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought patterns of exactingly perfect order…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.97,0:54:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信是那入侵者发射的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe they emanate from the intruder…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.97,0:54:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信它掌握着我的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe it may hold my answers…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.04,0:54:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们朝你而来是不是很幸福？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, isn't it Iucky for you that we're heading your way?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.58,0:54:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.88,0:54:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need him…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.72,0:54:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need him…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.39,0:54:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我的出现对我们双方都有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then my presence is to our mutual advantage…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.57,0:54:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感应到任何思想模式…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any thought patterns you might sense…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.47,0:54:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管影响你与否，马上向我报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether they affect you or not, I expect immediately reported…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.87,0:54:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.31,0:54:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有别的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.51,0:54:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.89,0:55:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,占？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.66,0:55:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这种超级智慧对他这么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this super intelligence is as important to him as he says…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.27,0:55:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.54,0:55:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会置他的利益于飞船之上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he wouldn't put his own interests ahead of the ship's?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.41,0:55:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信不会是那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never believe that…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.08,0:55:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,重估星云出现时间，3.7分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revised estimate on cloud visual contact. 3. 7 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.85,0:55:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my way…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.23,0:55:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,警报状况 红色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red alert…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.21,0:55:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,标准光度，工程师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard light, Engineer…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.68,0:55:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放大视像 - 放大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- FulI mag on viewer. - FulI mag, sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.99,0:56:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,语言吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linguacode?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.22,0:56:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有频率都是友善讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friendship messages on all frequencies…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.89,0:56:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有舱房确认，红色状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}All decks confirmed. Status red…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.36,0:56:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，我们被扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, we are being scanned…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.63,0:56:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别回应，可能会被视为敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not return scan. It could be misinterpreted as hostility…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.67,0:56:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,从星云中心发出的入侵者扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder scans emanating from the exact centre of the cloud…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.64,0:56:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种从未接触过的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energy of a type never before encountered…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.39,0:56:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,讯息没有回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No response to messages…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.32,0:56:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战机？- 不是，没有挑衅行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Battle stations? - Negative. No provocative action…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.09,0:56:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,建议作防御措施，庇护屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recommend defensive posture. Screens and shields…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.73,0:56:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，那可能也会被视为敌意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Mr Decker, that could also be misinterpreted as hostile…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.10,0:56:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴先生，星云结构？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloud composition, Mr Spock?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.10,0:56:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第十二级能量场 - 第十二级？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Twelfth-power energy field. - Twelfth?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.44,0:56:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见过他们的威力，要作防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've seen what they can do. We should take precautions…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.11,0:57:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑那星云的中心有一个物件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect there's an object at the heart of that cloud…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.25,0:57:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会挑起侵袭，如果不清楚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not provoke an attack. If that isn't clear…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.72,0:57:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为执行员，我有责任提出办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}As your Exec, it's my duty to point out alternatives…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.03,0:57:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is. I stand corrected…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.03,0:57:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟后到达星云边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes to cloud boundary…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.07,0:57:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定圆锥曲线航道进入星云中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navigator, lay in a conic section flight path to cloud centre…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.44,0:57:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面发现什么就跟它并行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring us parallel to whatever we find in there…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.14,0:57:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏洛，显示战术图像 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Sulu, tactical plot on viewer. - On viewer…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.40,0:57:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有第十二级能量？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That measures twelfth-power energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.57,0:57:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,几千艘飞船也产生不到那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of starships couldn't generate that much…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.88,0:58:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴，告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock, tell me…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.89,0:58:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感应到…困惑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sense…puzzlement…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.06,0:58:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被接触过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been contacted…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.73,0:58:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我们不回应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have we not replied?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.16,0:58:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,被接触过？怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contacted? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.87,0:58:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开力场！导向器，快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force fields up fulI! Deflectors, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.04,0:58:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,力场和导向器就位，队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force fields and deflectors up fulI, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.89,0:58:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,分析，冼朴先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Analysis, Mr Spock…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.12,0:58:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,外来武器是一种等离子体能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alien weapon is a form of plasma energy…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.26,0:58:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,结构不明，导航系统不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exact composition unknown. Guidance system unknown…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.20,0:58:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有舱面准备迎击\N{\fnArial\fs30}All decks brace for impact…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.97,0:59:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 工程组报告 - 系统负荷过量\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Engineering, status report. - Systems overloading…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.56,0:59:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 急救员 - 急救员快来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Medic. - Medics are coming…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.08,0:59:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,屏幕好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new screens held.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.00,0:59:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程组叫驾驶室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engineering to bridge…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.27,0:59:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持不到力场最高动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannot hold fulI power on force field…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.61,0:59:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,导向器动力下降了百分之七十！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deflector power is down 70 percent!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.17,0:59:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,转移辅助动力引导向器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divert auxiliary power to deflectors…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.99,0:59:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，入侵者一直在尝试通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, the intruder has been attempting to communicate…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.43,1:00:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,以这个速度，信息只维持一毫秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}At such speed, their entire message lasts only a millisecond…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.47,1:00:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会设定我们的电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will program our computer to transmit linguacode…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.74,1:00:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,以他们的频率和速度传送语言码\N{\fnArial\fs30}At their frequency and rate of speed…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.81,1:00:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.36,1:00:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.87,1:00:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它来了 - 我们的力场怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here it comes. - How is our force field?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.14,1:00:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的屏障应付不到另一次袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our shields cannot handle another attack!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.54,1:00:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Spock?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.20,1:00:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twerty seconds…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.42,1:00:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冼朴 - 十五秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spock. - 15 seconds…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.85,1:00:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴，快传送！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock, transmit now!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.02,1:00:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.62,1:00:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmitting…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.04,1:01:07.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们的信息已被接收和理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would seem our messages have been received and understood…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.08,1:01:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有纯逻辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}only pure logic…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.96,1:01:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 苏洛，保持现在位置 - 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Sulu, hold present position. - Holding position, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.20,1:01:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 战术图像 - 显示作战航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tactical plot on viewer. - Course projection on tactical, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.18,1:01:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 冼朴先生，意见 - 建议进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Opinion, Mr Spock. - Recommend we proceed…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.31,1:01:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Decker?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.55,1:01:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议防备，我们再抵不住袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I advise caution. We can't withstand another attack…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.95,1:01:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,那来历不明的东西离地球20小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing is 20 hours from Earth. We know nothing about it…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.76,1:01:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是，我们不知道它会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely the point. We don't know what it'll do…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.43,1:01:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在进入那星云是不必要的冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving into that cloud at this time is an unwarranted gamble…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.23,1:01:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么界定「不必要」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you define "unwarranted"?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.84,1:02:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问我的意见的，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked my opinion, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.52,1:02:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,视像器，显示前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viewer, standard ahead…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.06,1:02:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,领航员，保持航向，舵手，靠稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Navigator, maintain course. Helmsman, steady as she goes…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.85,1:04:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有飞船能产生这么大的动力场\N{\fnArial\fs30}No vessel could generate a power field of this magnitude…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.13,1:04:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，仪器不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instruments fIuctuating, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.77,1:04:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,模式不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patterns unrecognisable…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.72,1:06:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送影像到星际舰队，尝试通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmit image to Starfleet. Attempt communication…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.02,1:06:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,联络不到星际舰队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unable to make contact with Starfleet…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.09,1:06:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有从星云传送的信息都被射回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any attempt to transmit out of the cloud is being reflected back…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.30,1:07:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，我们迅速靠近它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're closing on it rapidly, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.08,1:07:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏洛先生，把放大量降至四级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reduce magnification factor four, Mr Sulu…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.35,1:07:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经降至两级以下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're already two settings below that…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.63,1:07:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏洛先生，驶进并行航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Sulu…bring us into a parallel course…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.03,1:07:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外星人上五百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the alien at 500 metres…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.40,1:07:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百米？\N{\fnArial\fs30}500 metres?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.54,1:07:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,驶出一百公里，调整并行航道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then take us out to 100 kilometres, adjusting parallel course…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.68,1:07:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.40,1:09:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船尾视像 - 调转视像角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Viewer astern. - Reverse angle on the viewer…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.35,1:10:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百米\N{\fnArial\fs30}500 metres…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.58,1:10:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,视像显示前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viewer ahead, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.37,1:12:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持双对位置在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold relative position here…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.41,1:13:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Spock!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.51,1:13:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可会是他们的船员之一？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can that be one of their crew?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.92,1:13:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们飞船的探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A probe from their vessel, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.52,1:13:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等离子体能量组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plasma-energy combination…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.06,1:13:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别干扰它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't interfere with it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.99,1:13:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，我不会干扰的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely, I will not interfere!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.16,1:13:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁也不得干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one interfere…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.30,1:13:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看来只对这艘飞船感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't seem interested in us, only the ship…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.75,1:14:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer off…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.36,1:14:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它控制了电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's taken control of the computer!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.54,1:14:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在检视我们的记录，地球防卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's running our records. Earth defences. Starfleet strength…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.41,1:15:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilia!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.30,1:15:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我说的「不必要」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I define "unwarranted"!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.48,1:15:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,经人手关闭，启动辅助电脑线路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Activate auxiliary computer circuits through manual shut-off…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.39,1:16:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家坐稳了，准备转向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency Alert! Negative control at helm!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.79,1:16:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船受到攻击，被吸过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force fields! Full remaining strength! Total reserve!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.93,1:16:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被一股光束袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been seized by a tractor beam…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.43,1:16:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,找人接上领航员的岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone take the Navigator's station…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.74,1:16:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用紧急动力 - 迪费高到驾驶室\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Engineering, emergency power. - DiFalco to bridge…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.41,1:16:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们15秒内不脱离就会燃烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, if we don't break free in 15 seconds, she'll burn up!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.81,1:16:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,办不到，我们只有少量的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot break free. We have only a fraction of the power necessary…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.02,1:16:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,工程组，延续命令切断主推进器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engineering, belay that order. Disengage main drive systems…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.37,1:16:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪费高总管，接管伊莉亚的岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief DiFalco, take over It Ilia's station…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.02,1:17:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪费高，切断机械导航继电器\N{\fnArial\fs30}DiFalco, disengage engine navigation relays now…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.79,1:17:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,E10至14力场线路准备重新启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Force field circuits E10 through 14 show ready for reactivation…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.49,1:17:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,请确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirm, please…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.43,1:17:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,史葛，推进系统应该脱离\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, drive systems should be free…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.13,1:17:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 指挥官 - 准备发射遥控侦察机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Commander. - Ready to launch remote drone…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.40,1:17:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,机上有本船记录，包括目前情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}With ship's records, incIuding our present situation…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.93,1:17:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别发射，我们被困侦察机逃不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delay launch. Our drone can't escape as long as we're held…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.21,1:17:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.07,1:17:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.53,1:17:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,用高度突变袭击可助我们脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}A maximum phaser strike might weaken it enough for us to break free…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.64,1:18:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱身去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break free to where?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.81,1:18:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何反抗都会无效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any show of resistance would be futile…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.58,1:18:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道，为何你反对尝试？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that, Mr Spock. Why are you opposed to trying?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.97,1:19:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要引我们进去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why bring us inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.54,1:19:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们早就可以在外面摧毁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to destroy us. They could have done that outside…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.97,1:19:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still can…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.87,1:19:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是好奇心，迪克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curiosity, Mr Decker…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.68,1:19:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法满足的好奇心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insatiable curiosity…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.56,1:19:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,光声纳读数显示孔径快将关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, photic sonar readings indicate the aperture is closing…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.13,1:19:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，我们被困了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trapped, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.96,1:19:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,调转视像角度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverse angle on the viewer…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.36,1:20:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，光束把我们释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tractor beam has released us, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.29,1:20:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认飞船在悬浮，没有前进动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmed. Vessel is floating free. No forward momentum…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.03,1:20:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,视像显示前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Viewer ahead…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.27,1:20:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏洛先生，推进器前进三分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manoeuvring thrusters, Mr Sulu. Ahead one third…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.54,1:20:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,推进器前进三分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrusters ahead one third…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.25,1:20:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴先生，启动感应扫描\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a look. FulI sensor scan, Mr Spock…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.26,1:20:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们该料到我们会扫描他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't expect us not to scan them now…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.39,1:20:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们往他们的喉咙看下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking down their throat…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.23,1:20:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在他们预料的位置中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got them just where they want us…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.91,1:20:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's closing up…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.42,1:21:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold position…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.56,1:21:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.56,1:21:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有扫描都被射回\N{\fnArial\fs30}All our scans are being reflected back…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.33,1:21:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感应器都是没用的 - 该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sensors are useless. - Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.28,1:21:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you make of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.74,1:21:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那关上的洞口是通往另一个室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the closed orifice leads to another chamber…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.91,1:21:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是这艘飞船部分的内部结构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undoubtedly, part of the vessel's inner mechanism…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.78,1:21:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑可能需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspect it may be necessary…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.39,1:21:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者警报！机组人员舱房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder alert! Officers' quarters…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.53,1:21:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫保安组到升降舵见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have Security meet me at the elevator…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.86,1:21:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴，迪克你来指挥，保持位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock. Mr Decker, you have the conn. Hold position…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.39,1:22:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是葛克组件，你要协助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the Kirk unit. You will assist me…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.66,1:22:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受「威者」程式来观察和记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been programmed by V'Ger to observe and record…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.57,1:22:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵扰企业号的碳化组件平常功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normal functions of the carbon-based units infesting USS Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.52,1:22:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 占，什么事？- 三维录像器\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jim, what's going on? - Tricorder…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.46,1:22:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.66,1:22:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,「威者」 ？\N{\fnArial\fs30}.. V'Ger?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.33,1:22:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程式就是威者输入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger is that which programmed me…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.30,1:23:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者是那艘飞船的船长名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is V'Ger the name of the captain of the alien vessel?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.70,1:23:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，这是个机械人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, this is a mechanism!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.04,1:23:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A probe, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.64,1:23:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是个感应收发组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}No doubt, a sensor-transceiver combination…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.11,1:23:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,记录我们所说和所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recording everything we say and do…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.72,1:23:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊莉亚在哪？- 那组件失效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's It Ilia? - That unit no longer functions…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.92,1:23:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以它的形体跟侵扰企业号的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been given its form to talk with the carbon-based units…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.76,1:23:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,碳化组件交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Infesting Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.89,1:23:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,碳化组件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carbon-based units?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.96,1:23:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类，安山佩雷斯，我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans, Ensign Perez. Us…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.20,1:23:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何威者要去太阳系的第三行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does V'Ger travel to the third planet of the solar system ahead?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.07,1:23:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了寻找创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find the Creator…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.91,1:23:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？创造者？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Creator?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.41,1:23:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.02,1:23:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者要创造者做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does V'Ger want with the Creator?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.42,1:23:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和他结合 - 和他结合？怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To join with him. - To join with the Creator? How?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.22,1:23:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者和创造者会合而为一\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger and the Creator will become one…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.93,1:24:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is the Creator?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.80,1:24:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者是创造威者的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Creator is that which created V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.87,1:24:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 威者是谁？- 威者搜寻创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is V'Ger? - That which seeks the Creator…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.74,1:24:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备开始进行我的观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to commence my observations…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.81,1:24:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,检验这个探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}An examination of this probe…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.81,1:24:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能探究到它由谁制造\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might provide insight into those who manufactured it…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.35,1:24:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 和怎样应付他们 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how to deal with them. - Fine…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.79,1:24:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她到医疗室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get her to sickbay…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.89,1:24:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的程式只是作观察和记录…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm programmed to observe and record…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.39,1:24:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,碳化组件的平常功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the normal functioning of the carbon units…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.10,1:24:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个检验是平常功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}The…examination is a normal function…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.24,1:24:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may proceed…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.18,1:24:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,超小型液压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Micro-miniature hydraulics…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.38,1:24:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,感应器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sensors…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.22,1:25:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有微型多重处理晶片\N{\fnArial\fs30}And molecule-sized multiprocessor chips…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.60,1:25:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看这个 - 微型渗透泵，这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And take a look at this. - Osmotic micro-pump. Right here…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.84,1:25:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最微小的身体机能也复制了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the smallest body functions are exactly duplicated…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.98,1:25:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有外分泌系统也是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every exocrine system is the same, too…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.75,1:25:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至有眼水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even eye moisture…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.32,1:25:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇妙，竟然不是叫「迪克组件」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating. Not "Decker unit"
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.49,1:25:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.60,1:25:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.61,1:25:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她发生了什么事？- 队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to her? - Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.01,1:25:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这探测器或是追查外星人的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}This probe may be our key to the aliens…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.48,1:26:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 探测器？伊莉亚？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Probe? Ilia? - Exactly…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.45,1:26:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一个被编了程式的机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a programmed mechanism…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.82,1:26:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,它精确复制我们的领航员的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its body duplicates our Navigator in precise detail…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.49,1:26:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,假若在它的程式当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suppose that beneath its programming…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.82,1:26:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚的记忆也同样被精确复制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilia's memory patterns are duplicated with equal precision…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.63,1:26:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们有一个模式可跟随 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They had a pattern to follow. - Indeed…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.10,1:26:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能跟得太精确了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may have followed it too precisely…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.90,1:26:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚的记忆、 忠心服从、 友情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilia's memory, her feelings of loyalty, obedience, friendship…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.31,1:26:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能都在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might all be there!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.01,1:26:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟伊莉亚曾经有一段情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did have a relationship with It Ilia…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.18,1:26:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那模仿的探测器杀死伊莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That probe in another form is what killed Ilia!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.91,1:26:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.82,1:26:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困在一艘外星人飞船内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will. We're locked in an alien vessel six hours from Earth…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.79,1:26:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那探测器是与俘虏者唯一的接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only contact with our captor is that probe…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.42,1:26:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们可以控制它，利用它…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could control it, use it…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.23,1:26:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记录够了，你们要再协助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have recorded enough here. You will now assist me further…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.77,1:26:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克组件可以更有效地协助你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Decker unit can assist you with much greater efficiency…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.45,1:27:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克先生，执行你的任务吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry on with your assignment, Mr Decker…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.45,1:27:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.19,1:27:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心那是我们唯一的资料来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am concerned with that being our only source of information…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.63,1:27:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长日志，星际日期7414.1\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain's log, stardate 7414.1…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.20,1:27:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最乐观估计距离地球四小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our best estimates place us four hours from Earth…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.07,1:27:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前仍未有重大进展\N{\fnArial\fs30}No significant progress thus far…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.31,1:27:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,在探测器体内还原伊莉亚的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reviving Ilia memory patterns within the alien probe…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.18,1:27:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们仍只有这个方法联络俘虏者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This remains our only means of contact with our captor…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.21,1:27:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些飞船都是叫做企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those vessels were called Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.16,1:27:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些碳化组件在这个范围消遣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The carbon units use this area for recreation…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.33,1:28:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是其中一种游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is one of the games…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.87,1:28:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的船员喜欢什么消遣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What types of recreation does the crew aboard your vessel enjoy?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.81,1:28:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,「消遣」和「喜欢」这些字眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The words "recreation" and "enjoy"…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.42,1:28:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的程式中没有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have no meaning to my programming…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.13,1:28:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚喜欢玩这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilia enjoyed this game…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.16,1:28:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她经常赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She nearly always won…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.67,1:28:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好，他在利用视听联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. He's using audio-visual association…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.41,1:29:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个装置没有用途\N{\fnArial\fs30}This device serves no purpose…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.06,1:29:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何企业号要有碳化组件在船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does Enterprise require the presence of carbon units?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.63,1:29:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他们，企业号不能运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise could not function without them…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.80,1:29:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有更多关于这个功能的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}More data concerning this functioning is necessary…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.94,1:29:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,碳化组件才能用作储存资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before carbon units can be patterned for data storage…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.18,1:29:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.11,1:29:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的检验完成之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my examination is complete…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.88,1:29:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有碳化组件都会缩成资料模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}All carbon units will be reduced to data patterns…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.12,1:30:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内有某个碳化组件的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within you are the memory patterns of…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.06,1:30:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}A certain carbon unit…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.49,1:30:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我能帮你还原那些模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can help you to revive those patterns…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.63,1:30:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就可以更了解我们的功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could understand our functions better…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.60,1:30:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很合逻辑，你可以进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is logical. You may proceed…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.58,1:31:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得伊莉亚提过她戴这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember It Ilia once mentioning she wore that…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.72,1:31:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在德尔塔星，记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Delta. Remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.89,1:31:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilia?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.66,1:31:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卓普医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr Chapel…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.77,1:31:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.74,1:31:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilia…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.21,1:31:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.15,1:31:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一副机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a mechanism…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.79,1:31:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚，帮我们直接联络威者吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilia, help us make direct contact with V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.20,1:32:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.27,1:32:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者找的创造者是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Creator V'Ger's looking for. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.34,1:32:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger does not know…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.77,1:32:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑，开始记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Computer, commence recording…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.71,1:32:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛克队长，这些信息会详细记下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capt Kirk, these messages will detail my attempt…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.21,1:32:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝试接触外星人的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}To contact the aliens…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.15,1:32:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告，紧急逃离推进器已装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning! Your emergency evacuation thruster pack has been armed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.85,1:33:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,点火后推进时间10秒 按点火钮后开始倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once ignited, the burn duration is 10 seconds and may not be aborted.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.85,1:33:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开把手可除去装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push the igniter-enable release to begin a 10-second countdown…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.35,1:33:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会计算加速程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to calculate acceleration rate…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.39,1:33:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,去配合那个威者洞口的开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}To coincide with the opening of the V'Ger orifice…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.19,1:33:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样该有助看清楚内部\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should facilitate a better view of the interior…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.94,1:33:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官，星际舰队的讯号越来越强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet signals are growing in strength, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.54,1:33:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍监察到那个入侵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still have the intruder on their monitors…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.91,1:33:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它正在减速 - 确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's decelerating. - Confirmed…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.28,1:33:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,月球信标显示入侵者入地球轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iunar beacons indicate intruder on a course into Earth orbit…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.01,1:33:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,四号气窝开了，一件推进衣失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, airlock four has been opened. A thruster suit is reported missing…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.76,1:33:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件推进衣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thruster suit?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.29,1:33:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冼朴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Spock…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.43,1:34:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他该死！把他带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn him! Bring him back here…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.07,1:34:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.77,1:34:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找出他的位置 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get a fix on his position. - Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.66,1:34:27.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（武器装置）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.93,1:34:35.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（开动发射器）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:40.27,1:34:41.26,Note,0,0,0,0,,（发射）
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.75,1:35:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已穿过外星人内部的另一个室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have penetrated the next chamber of the alien's interior…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.56,1:35:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见某种立体影像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm witnessing some sort of dimensional image…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.83,1:35:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信是代表威者的原居行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I believe is a representation of V'Ger's home planet…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.97,1:35:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正通过一条连接的隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm passing through a connecting tunnel…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.91,1:35:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是一种等离子体能量管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently a kind of plasma-energy conduit…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.95,1:35:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是个巨型影响系统的场线圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly, a field coil for a gigantic imaging system…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.19,1:36:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪，我看见行星、 月亮、 星宿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious. I'm seeing images of planets. Moons. Stars…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.10,1:36:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个银河系被储存和记录起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whole galaxies stored, recorded…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.17,1:36:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能代表了威者的整个旅程\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be a representation of V'Ger's entire journey…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.94,1:36:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们要应付的是谁或是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who or what are we dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.65,1:36:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,E9太空站被详细地储存在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Epsilon IX station, stored here with every detail…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.79,1:36:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，我相信这一切就是威者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I am now quite convinced that all of this is V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.26,1:36:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一副活的机器里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we are inside a living machine…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.85,1:37:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个感应器一定有特别用意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sensor…must contain some special meaning…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.22,1:37:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要尝试和它融合意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must try to mind-meld with it…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.13,1:38:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在扫描脊骨神经纤维连接范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now scanning pons area. Spinal nerve fibre connection…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.87,1:38:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示有一些神经性创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indications of some neurological trauma…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.74,1:38:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞击那意识融合的动力一定很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The power pouring through that mind-meld must have been staggering…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.66,1:39:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 你对威者的看法对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should have known. - Were you right? About V'Ger?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.13,1:39:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有知觉的活体\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life form of its own. A conscious, living entity…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.14,1:39:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一副活机器？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A living machine?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.64,1:39:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它视企业号为一副活机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It considers the Enterprise a living machine…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.98,1:39:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见威者的行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw V'Ger's planet…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.35,1:39:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个住了很多活机器的行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}A planet populated by living machines…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.02,1:39:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议的科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable technology…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.46,1:39:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者拥有跨越这个宇宙的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger has knowledge that spans this universe…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.69,1:39:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，以它所有的纯逻辑来说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, with all its pure logic…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.60,1:39:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者是荒芜、 冰冷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger is barren. Cold…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.87,1:39:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有神秘的动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}No mystery…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.67,1:39:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有美感\N{\fnArial\fs30}No beauty…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.41,1:39:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have… known…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.95,1:39:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道？知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known? Known what?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.69,1:40:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早该知道什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should you have known?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.17,1:40:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种简单的感觉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This simple feeling…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.64,1:40:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者是无法领会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is beyond V'Ger's comprehension…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.52,1:40:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有意义，没有希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}No meaning. No hope…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.49,1:40:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}No answers…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.89,1:40:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在发问\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's asking questions…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.36,1:40:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我是否…就是这样？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Is this… all that I am?"
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.80,1:40:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,「还有别的吗？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Is there nothing more?"
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.74,1:41:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶室叫队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge to Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.88,1:41:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是葛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk here…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.12,1:41:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队发出微弱讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}A faint signal from Starfleet, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.25,1:41:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者星云在监视器上27分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intruder cloud has been located on the monitors for 27 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.19,1:41:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,星云在靠近时迅速消散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cloud dissipating rapidly as it approaches…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.86,1:41:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队说速度减至负翘曲度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet reports velocity is slowed to subwarp speed…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.60,1:41:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们距离地球轨道三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are three minutes from Earth orbit…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.63,1:41:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.67,1:41:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要冼朴到驾驶室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need Spock on the bridge…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.91,1:41:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,5c.c.德拉菲素\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dalaphaline, five ccs…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.57,1:41:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器…发射机器到地球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A machine planet sending a machine to Earth,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.97,1:41:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,寻找创制者，实在难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for its Creator. It's absolutely incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.63,1:42:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队发放这个威者位置图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet is sending this tactical on V'Ger's position…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.10,1:42:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,航空在传送一个讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger is transmitting a signal…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.91,1:42:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,占！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.28,1:42:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从威者发来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.78,1:42:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者向创造者发出讯号\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger signals the Creator…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.06,1:42:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种由载波传送的三进制代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}A simple binary code, transmitted by carrier-wave signal…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.73,1:42:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.97,1:43:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.51,1:43:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，威者要一个答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, V'Ger expects an answer…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.08,1:43:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案？我不知问题是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}An answer? I don't know the question…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.72,1:43:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者没有回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Creator has not responded…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.33,1:43:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有行星防御系统都失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All planetary defence systems have just gone inoperative…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.01,1:44:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队说那些装置…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet says the devices are proceeding…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.91,1:44:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备以等距位置环绕这个行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}To equidistant positions orbiting the planet!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.95,1:44:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是撞击我们的那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same things that hit us…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.95,1:44:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的威力强几百倍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are hundreds of times more powerful…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.86,1:44:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们可从那些位置摧毁整个行星\N{\fnArial\fs30}From those positions, they could devastate the entire planet…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.04,1:44:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.71,1:44:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者没有回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Creator has not answered…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.04,1:44:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,要从这个行星消除碳化组件侵扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The carbon-unit infestation is to be removed from the planet…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.35,1:44:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？- 你们侵扰企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? - You infest Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.05,1:45:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们同样干扰着创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You interfere with the Creator in the same manner…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.48,1:45:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Machine!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.83,1:45:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.60,1:45:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者是个小孩，你该这样对待她\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger is a child. I suggest you treat her as such…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.01,1:45:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小孩？- 对，队长，小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A child? - Yes, Captain. A child…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.74,1:45:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,进化、 学习、 搜寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evolving, learning, searching…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.28,1:45:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 本能地有需要 - 需要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Instinctively needing. - Needing what?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.15,1:45:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小孩快摧毁地球所有生物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock! This child is about to wipe out every living thing on Earth!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.49,1:45:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提议我们怎办？打它的屁股？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you suggest we do? Spank it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.66,1:46:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只知道它有需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It knows only that it needs, Commander…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.23,1:46:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但像我们一样，不知道需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, like so many of us, it does not know what…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.19,1:46:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,碳化组件知道为何创造者没回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}The carbon units know why the Creator has not responded…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.19,1:46:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说出资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disclose the information…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.19,1:46:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者再撤销环绕第三行星的装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until V'Ger withdraws the devices orbiting the third planet…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.37,1:46:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.97,1:46:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收不到星际舰了！威者干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing Starfleet! Interference from V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.37,1:46:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛克组件，快说出资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk unit, disclose the information…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.74,1:46:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何创造者没有回应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why has the Creator not responded?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.75,1:46:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.72,1:46:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护所有岗位，撤离驾驶室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure all stations. Clear the bridge…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.16,1:47:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离驾驶室？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the bridge, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.39,1:47:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是命令，撤离驾驶室\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the order. Clear the bridge…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.80,1:47:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小孩发脾气了，冼朴先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your child is having a tantrum, Mr Spock…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.74,1:47:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者要那个资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger requires the information…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.75,1:47:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾驶室！保护所有岗位，快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge! Secure all stations. Move out…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.35,1:47:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，这到底是什么策略？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, what the hell kind of strategy is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.42,1:47:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船转为自动操作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ship's functions going to automatic…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.06,1:47:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者摧毁企业号，资料也被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If V'Ger destroys the Enterprise, the information will be destroyed…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.20,1:47:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒给所需资料是合逻辑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is illogical to withhold required information…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.37,1:47:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛克组件！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk unit!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.57,1:47:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你不说出资料？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you not disclose information?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.91,1:47:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者会摧毁第三行星的碳化组件\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger will destroy the carbon units on the third planet…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.22,1:47:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们镇压创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They repressed the Creator…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.22,1:48:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说出资料的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The information will not be disclosed!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.92,1:48:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者需要那些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger needs the information…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.02,1:48:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么威者要先撤销那些环绕装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then V'Ger must withdraw all the orbiting devices…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.80,1:48:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,若碳化组件说出资料，威者同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger will comply, if the carbon units will disclose the information…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.41,1:48:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它学得很快，是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It learns fast, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.54,1:48:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，那艘飞船，威者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, the vessel, V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.88,1:48:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显是从一个中央脑体运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously operates from a central brain complex…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.02,1:48:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些环绕装置是从那个点控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}The orbiting devices are controlled from that point…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.65,1:48:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.03,1:48:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能把资料说给威者的探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The information cannot be disclosed to V'Ger's probe…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.97,1:48:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可直接告诉威者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only to V'Ger, directly…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.16,1:49:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 前进，队长 - 光束\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forward motion, Captain. - Tractor beam…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.85,1:49:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，下一步怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, what's the next move?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.75,1:49:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是，有没有下一步？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, Mr Decker, is there a next move?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.86,1:49:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,返回工作岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resume duty stations…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.63,1:49:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人员返回岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All personnel, resume stations…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.97,1:50:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克先生，看来我的吹牛奏效了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Mr Decker, it seems my bIuff has been called…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.14,1:50:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我们胜算不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid our hand is weak, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.12,1:50:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些装置几时到达最后位置？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Chekov, when do those devices reach final position?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.19,1:50:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十七分钟，确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}27 minutes. Mark…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.94,1:50:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长，我相信那是我们的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, I believe that is our destination…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.62,1:50:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号外形成了一股氧气引力罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}An oxygen gravity envelope is forming outside the Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.26,1:50:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来了，队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward motion stopped, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.64,1:51:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.34,1:51:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到威者的无线电讯号来源了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I've located the source of V'Ger's radio signal…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.41,1:51:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's directly ahead…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.21,1:51:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那发射器是威者和创造者的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That transmitter is a vital link between V'Ger and its Creator…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.65,1:51:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,碳化组件现在给威者说出资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}The carbon units will now provide V'Ger with the required information…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.80,1:51:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克先生，我每隔五分钟联络你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Decker. I will contact you every five minutes…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.81,1:51:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.71,1:51:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to go along…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.85,1:51:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏洛先生，你暂代指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Sulu, you have the conn…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.40,1:53:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:55.54,1:54:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者\N{\fnArial\fs30}V-G-E-R…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.55,1:55:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.96,1:55:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海家号\N{\fnArial\fs30}V-O-Y-A-G-E-R…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.00,1:55:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海家号！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyager!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.34,1:55:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海家六号？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyager VI?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.41,1:55:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空总署\N{\fnArial\fs30}NASA. National Aeronautics and Space Administration…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.78,1:55:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，这是三百年前发射的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, this was launched more than 300 years ago…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.98,1:55:42.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海家号系列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyager series…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.62,1:55:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责收集资料和把它传送回地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Designed to collect data, and transmit it back to Earth…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.47,1:56:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.40,1:56:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海家六号消失在黑洞中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyager VI disappeared into what they used to call a black hole…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.41,1:56:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定是出现在银河系的另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must have emerged on the far side of the galaxy…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.51,1:56:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再掉进这机械行星的引力场\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fell into the machine planet's gravitational field…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.85,1:56:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些机械居民以为是它们的同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machine inhabiters found it to be one of their own kind…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.29,1:56:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,原始但类似\N{\fnArial\fs30}Primitive yet kindred…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.95,1:56:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现它简单的二十世纪程式\N{\fnArial\fs30}They discovered its simple 20th-century programming…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.39,1:56:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集所有的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Collect all data possible…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.63,1:57:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽量学习它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learn all that is learnable…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.46,1:57:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那些资料送返它的创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return that information to its Creator…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.50,1:57:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确，迪克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely, Mr Decker…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.64,1:57:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些机器把它逐字解读\N{\fnArial\fs30}The machines interpreted it literally…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.24,1:57:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造这飞船让航海家号完成程式\N{\fnArial\fs30}They built this entire vessel so Voyager could fulfil its programming…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.91,1:57:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在它的回程中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on its journey back…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.92,1:57:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它积累了大量知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}It amassed so much knowledge…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.79,1:57:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己达致有意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}It achieved consciousness itself…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.99,1:57:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为了一个生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It became a living thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.27,1:57:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,葛克组件，威者等着那些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kirk unit. V'Ger awaits the information…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.01,1:57:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号，在船上电脑记录图书馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise, order up the ship's computer library of records…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.88,1:57:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻查20世纪太空总署航海家六号\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the late 20th-century NASA probe, Voyager VI…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.42,1:58:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要那套太空总署\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want the old NASA code signal…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:02.29,1:58:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,指示探测器传送资料的旧讯号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}That instructs the probe to transmit its data…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.49,1:58:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乌拉，快点！- 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And fast, Uhura! - Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.13,1:58:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它发出准备传送资料的讯号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been signalling its readiness to transmit its information…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.23,1:58:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球没有人懂得旧讯号和回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one on Earth could recognise the old signal and respond…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.60,1:58:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者没有回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Creator does not answer…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.35,1:58:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.20,1:58:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Creator…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.04,1:58:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合逻辑，碳组件不是真生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is not logical. Carbon units are not true life forms…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.11,1:58:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会证明它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will prove it…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.34,1:58:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会让你可以完成你的程式\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will make it possible for you to complete your programming…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.75,1:59:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有创造者可以做得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the Creator could accomplish that…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:02.32,1:59:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.55,1:59:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚收到那套回应代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have just received the response code…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.62,1:59:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把企业号发射器调校至合适频率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set the Enterprise transmitter on appropriate frequency…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.16,1:59:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻传送那套代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}And transmit the code now…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.66,1:59:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,传送中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transmitting…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.77,1:59:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的列数是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the final sequence…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.71,1:59:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该可以启动航海家号的发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should trigger Voyager's transmitter…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.26,1:59:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海家号没有传送它的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyager is not transmitting its data, Captain…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.99,1:59:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者要跟威者结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Creator must join with V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.07,1:59:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌拉，重复最后的列数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uhura, repeat the final sequence…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.27,2:00:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造者要跟威者结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Creator must join with V'Ger…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.83,2:00:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,航海家号没有传送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Voyager is not transmitting…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.13,2:00:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它接收不到最后的列数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it did not receive the final sequence…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.77,2:00:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们剩下十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're down to ten minutes…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.50,2:00:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,企业号，准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enterprise, stand by…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.15,2:00:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天线引线溶了 - 刚被威者溶掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The antenna leads are melted away. - Yes, just now. By V'Ger itself…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.62,2:00:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.96,2:00:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 防止接收 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To prevent reception. - Of course…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.16,2:00:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把创造者带来，完成传送代码\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bring the Creator here. To finish transmitting the code in person…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:00.60,2:01:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了接触创造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}To touch the Creator…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.34,2:01:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,捕捉神？威者会大失所望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capture God? V'Ger's in for one hell of a disappointment…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:09.91,2:01:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps not, Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.90,2:01:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.24,2:01:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者一定要进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}V'Ger must evolve…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.15,2:01:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的知识已达到这个宇宙的极限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its knowledge has reached the limits of this universe…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:49.22,2:01:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它需要的是它的问题的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it requires is the answer to its question…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.55,2:01:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「还有别的吗？」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Is there nothing more?"
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.99,2:01:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙之外还有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more is there than the universe?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.86,2:01:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的空间，生物状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other dimensions, levels of being…
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.93,2:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的存在不能被逻辑性地证明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose existence cannot be proven logically…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.63,2:02:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以威者不能相信它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therefore, V'Ger is incapable of believing in them…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.83,2:02:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,威者需要人类的品质才能进化\N{\fnArial\fs30}What V'Ger needs in order to evolve is a human quality…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:09.87,2:02:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们超越逻辑的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our capacity to leap beyond logic…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.28,2:02:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟它的创造者结合就可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joining with its Creator might accomplish that…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:19.01,2:02:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这副机器要亲身跟一个人类结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}This machine wants to physically join with a human?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.98,2:02:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.16,2:02:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.47,2:02:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会经地面测试电脑输入列数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll key the sequence through the ground-test computer…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:42.40,2:02:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道会有什么后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what that'll do!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.07,2:02:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道，医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I do, Doctor…
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.28,2:02:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克，不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decker, don't!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.55,2:03:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,占，像想要企业号般，我要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, I want this. As much as you wanted the Enterprise, I want this…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.97,2:05:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.90,2:06:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,冼朴！我们是否看见新生物诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spock! Did we just see the beginning of a new life form?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.64,2:06:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我们见证了一次诞生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Captain. We witnessed a birth…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.91,2:06:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可能是我们进化过程的下一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly a next step in our evolution…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.65,2:06:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀疑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.38,2:06:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没有接生婴儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time since I delivered a baby…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.52,2:06:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希望它有个好开始 - 但愿如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hope it got off to a good start. - I hope so, too…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.22,2:06:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给了它创造自己目标的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we gave it the ability to create its own sense of purpose…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.83,2:06:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭我们人类的弱点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of our own human weaknesses…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.67,2:06:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,和克服它们的精神而达成\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the drive that compels us to overcome them…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.14,2:06:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很多愚蠢的人类感情，是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a lot of foolish human emotions, right, Mr Spock?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.11,2:06:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，可惜它也要应付它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite true, Doctor. Unfortunately, it will have to deal with them as well…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.88,2:06:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,星际舰队要求损毁和受伤报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starfleet request damage and injury reports and vessel status…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.32,2:06:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告有两人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report two casualties…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.69,2:06:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊莉亚中尉，迪克队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}It Ilia. Capt Decker…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.99,2:06:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.23,2:06:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,更正，他们不是受伤，他们是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction. They're not casualties. They are…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.33,2:07:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们列为失踪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}List them as missing…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.00,2:07:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 飞船运作完全正常 - 是，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vessel status fully operational. - Aye, sir…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.24,2:07:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,史葛先生！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Scott!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.34,2:07:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可要给企业号一次彻底试航\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we give the Enterprise a proper shakedown?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.41,2:07:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候那样做了，长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say it's time for that, sir…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.31,2:07:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可在四天内送你去火神星\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can have you on Vulcan in four days, Mr Spock…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.28,2:07:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了，我在火神星的任务已完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unnecessary, Mr Scott. My task on Vulcan is completed…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.62,2:07:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏洛先生？翘曲度一级前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Sulu? Ahead warp one…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.13,2:07:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,翘曲度一级\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warp one, sir…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.39,2:07:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪里，长官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heading, sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:33.77,2:07:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out there…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.34,2:07:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thataway.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.59,2:08:34.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（人类的冒险之旅才刚开始）
